### ============================================
### Users API - /users Controller
### HTTP Client Test Documentation
### ============================================

### Variables (adjust as needed)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userId =
@authToken =

### NOTES:
### - The project includes initial seed data (DataInitializer) with sample users:
###   john.doe@example.com (password: A1234567)
###   jane.smith@example.com (password: B1234567)
### - Available endpoints in UserController:
###   GET    /users/me
###   PUT    /users/me
###   GET    /users/{id}
###   GET    /users
###   DELETE /users/{id}
###   DELETE /users/me

### ============================================
### 1. GET MY PROFILE (GET) - Authentication required
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### ============================================
### 2. UPDATE MY PROFILE (PUT) - Replaces allowed fields only
### ============================================
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
# Request body must follow UpdateUserCommand structure (only allowed fields)

{
  "name": "Juan Updated",
  "firstName": "Pérez",
  "lastName": "Gómez",
  "phoneNumber": "3000000000",
  "birthDate": "1998-05-10",
  "isActive": true,
  "role": "USER",
  "gender": "MALE"
}

### ============================================
### 3. GET USER BY ID (GET)
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ============================================
### 4. LIST USERS (GET) - Optional filters
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?gender=MALE&role=USER&active=true&page=0&size=20
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### ============================================
### 5. DELETE USER BY ID (DELETE)
### ============================================
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### ============================================
### 6. DELETE MY ACCOUNT (DELETE) - Authentication required
### ============================================
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
# Add Authorization: Bearer <token> header if applicable
